"The + at the left of the notch's top row starts a tab in a folder you pick: your login shell goes to the folder, then runs the command, so your PATH and the agent's own sign-in apply. Each tab is a widget on the dashboard that opens into its terminal, and it keeps running while the notch is closed. After Scout restarts the tabs come back by themselves, each in its folder, and the agents continue with the resume command; with that switched off they wait under + › Resume instead." = "瀏海頂列最左邊的 + 會在你選擇的資料夾中開始一個標籤頁：你的登入 Shell 會進入該資料夾，然後執行指令，所以你的 PATH 和代理自己的登入都會生效。每個標籤頁都是儀表板上的一個小工具，開啟後會變成它的終端機，並且在瀏海闔上時仍會繼續執行。Scout 重新啟動後，標籤頁會自己回來，各自回到自己的資料夾，代理會用繼續指令繼續；關閉該選項時，它們會改為在 + › 繼續 下等待。";
