"The camera runs only while the Mirror tab or widget is on screen. The camera key under the picture copies a picture of it to the clipboard; Share makes a polaroid with your agents and shows it before anything is shared. macOS asks for camera access the first time you press the button to turn it on. External and iPhone cameras show up in the list." = "只有在「鏡子」標籤頁或小工具顯示在螢幕上時，相機才會執行。畫面下方的相機鍵會把畫面圖片拷貝到剪貼簿；「分享」會產生一張帶有你的代理的拍立得，並在分享任何內容之前先展示給你。你第一次按下開啟相機的按鈕時，macOS 會詢問相機取用權限。外接相機和 iPhone 相機會顯示在列表中。";
